          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiling’ ungo ni kum Sayuni, man abiyom ungo ni kum Yerusalem, ma fodi bedopwe pare ku dhenjre woko ngo calu der, man both pare calu thala m’uliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man thek bineno bedopwe peri, man ju m’ubimo ceke bineno dwong’ peri; man jubilwong’i ku nying’ ma nyen, ma Yehova bicaku ku dhoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibedo jamkermiwic mi leng’ bende i cing’ Yehova, man giratwia m’i wie mi ker i cing’ Mungu peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubilwong’i Udhuru kendo ngo; kadok ng’om peri de jubilwong’o Uvuru kendo ngo: ento jubilwong’i Hefziba, man ng’om peri Beyula; kum anyong’a nego Yehova i kumi, man ng’om peri bigambre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum calu jalawobi gamu mugole, e woti bigemi kumeca; man calu anyong’a nego won ambadha kum mugole, e anyong’a binego Mungu peri i kumi kumeca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aketho jukur wi gang’kidi peri, E Yerusalem; gibibedo ling’ ungo ku dieceng’ kadi ku diewor: wun ma wu weg poi pa Yehova, kud wuyom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kud wumi ire yom, ma fok’eketho ecungo ngo, man ma fok’edwoko Yerusalem ni pak ungo i ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova kwong’o ku cinge ma yor acwic, man ku bot mi tego pare kumae, Andha abimio cam peri ngo ni cemo ni judegini; man juwirok bimadhu pigulok peri ma nyasa ngo, m’imuli ku tic pire: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ju m’upone bicame, man gibipaku Yehova; man ju m’ucoke gibimadhe i lelagang’ mi kamaleng’ para.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
